   "name": "Baldur's Gate 3",
   "short": "BG3",
   "inPool": true,
   "coverage": "Baldur's Gate 3 is a Dungeons & Dragons campaign on the Sword Coast in Faerûn, where your traveling party's personal quests become part of your story. Companions have more agency than typical RPG party members, and their personal quests tie into the main quest. Combat is turn-based, while exploration is real-time. Spells interact with the battlefield, so one can set up a combined effect with a follow-up spell.",
