  {
   "appid": 1145350,
   "name": "Hades II",
   "short": "Hades II",
   "inPool": true,
   "coverage": "Hades II casts you as Melinoë, a young woman raised by Hecate, the witch of the Crossroads. Her fight stems from urgent necessity rather than rebellion, and you fight your way down through the underworld to confront Chronos, the Titan of Time. Each run, divine boons from the gods of Olympus shape your build. In the Early Access build, clearing a room lets you choose the next from doors showing a god's gift or a resource reward. Post-game play adds challenge runs, extra upgrade paths and an extended endgame. Melinoë plays in a more considered and cerebral way than Zagreus, who relied on rushdown-style aggression. The game has two distinct paths, each with its own bosses, enemies and storylines.",
