  {
   "appid": 1091500,
   "name": "Cyberpunk 2077",
   "short": "Cyberpunk",
   "inPool": true,
   "coverage": "Cyberpunk 2077 follows V through Night City, which is dense, diverse, and consistently beautiful, and its central questline is surprisingly short but compelling. Your confrontational relationship with Johnny Silverhand anchors the story. Your choices have a major impact on V's story, and completing optional character stories can change how the main story ends. Several boss battles are tedious, though. Many optional quests come through phone calls, so you often don't need to seek out quest givers. The main story took about 20 hours to finish.",
